      {
        "text": "Quarterly figures are reported as annualized quarter-over-quarter rates: Q4 2023 grew at 3.3 percent and Q3 2023 at 4.9 percent. These quarterly annualized rates measure the pace within each quarter, whereas the 2.5 percent annual figure is a full-year (annual-level to annual-level) growth rate, so they are not directly comparable and quarterly rates can differ substantially from the annual rate.",
        "kind": "model_interpretation",
